      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const html = `\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<style>\n\nbody{\nfont-family:Arial;\nmargin:40px;\ncolor:#333;\n}\n\n.header{\nborder-bottom:4px solid #2563eb;\npadding-bottom:20px;\nmargin-bottom:30px;\n}\n\ntable{\nwidth:100%;\nborder-collapse:collapse;\nmargin-top:20px;\n}\n\ntd,th{\nborder:1px solid #ddd;\npadding:10px;\n}\n\n.total{\nmargin-top:30px;\nfont-size:22px;\nfont-weight:bold;\ntext-align:right;\ncolor:#2563eb;\n}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n\n<h1>Orithm AI</h1>\n\n<h2>INVOICE</h2>\n\n</div>\n\n<table>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td><b>Invoice ID</b></td>\n\n<td>${$input.first().json.Invoice_ID}</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td><b>Client</b></td>\n\n<td>${$input.first().json.Client_Name}</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td><b>Company</b></td>\n\n<td>${$('Parse Invoice').first().json.Company}</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td><b>Project</b></td>\n\n<td>${$('Parse Invoice').first().json.Project_Title}</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n<td><b>Invoice Date</b></td>\n\n<td>${new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</td>\n\n</tr>\n\n</table>\n\n<h3>Invoice Summary</h3>\n\n<p>\nThis invoice covers the services provided for the above-mentioned project by Orithm AI. The charges listed reflect the agreed scope of work completed during the billing period. Thank you for your business and continued trust.\n</p>\n\n<h3>Payment Terms</h3>\n\n<p>\nPayment is due within 7 days from the invoice date. Please include the Invoice ID as the payment reference. Any delay in payment may result in applicable late charges as per the agreed terms. For any questions regarding this invoice, please contact the Orithm AI team.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"total\">\n\nInvoice : ₹${$input.first().json.Invoice_Amount}<br>\n\nGST : ₹${$input.first().json.GST}<br>\n\nTotal : ₹${$input.first().json.Total_Amount}\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n\n</html>\n`;\n\nreturn [{\njson:{\n...$json,\nhtml\n}\n}];"
      },
